    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elements got transported into the physical world! Will you be the hero to defeat them? Well\u2026 No. <i>You are the Elements!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a breach mysteriously opened in the elemental world, Air, Fire, Stone and Water\u00a0explore this new land and discover\u00a0concepts they would never have imagined - such as 'forests', 'tides' or even 'people'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foes will arise to challenge the Elements into turn based, grid based battles. On each expedition, you will receive unique artefacts granting you special abilities - but your enemies all have unique skills themselves. Will you be outsmarted by an AI?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playtest is currently free and features the whole content of the game, but please - remember to share your feedback, that is of the utmost importance to me\u00a0\ud83d\ude42</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elements got transported into the physical world! Will you be the hero to defeat them? Well\u2026 No. <i>You are the Elements!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a breach mysteriously opened in the elemental world, Air, Fire, Stone and Water\u00a0explore this new land and discover\u00a0concepts they would never have imagined - such as 'forests', 'tides' or even 'people'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foes will arise to challenge the Elements into turn based, grid based battles. On each expedition, you will receive unique artefacts granting you special abilities - but your enemies all have unique skills themselves. Will you be outsmarted by an AI?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playtest is currently free and features the whole content of the game, but please - remember to share your feedback, that is of the utmost importance to me\u00a0\ud83d\ude42</p>",
    "short_description": "A tactical rogue-lite set in a medieval-fantastic scenery. Defend yourself against your foes, learn the magic of this realm, and discover the deepest secrets of its inhabitants",
